      <input x="480" y="970" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(1) Instagrid ONE max is the only AC" />
      <input x="480" y="986" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="source. Continuous current is 15.7 A." />
      <input x="480" y="1002" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(2) Q1 does not switch PE. QF1 is type B," />
      <input x="480" y="1018" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="30 mA. The dashed line is the mechanical" />
      <input x="480" y="1034" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="link." />
      <input x="480" y="1050" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(3) F4 feeds the S200 supply. F5 feeds the" />
      <input x="480" y="1066" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="general 24 V supply. Both continue on" />
      <input x="480" y="1082" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="folio 03." />
      <input x="480" y="1098" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(4) A crossing without a dot is not a" />
