      <input x="480" y="874" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(1) Contact 13-14 is STO channel 1." />
      <input x="480" y="890" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="Contact 23-24 is STO channel 2. The" />
      <input x="480" y="906" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="section is 0.75 mm2." />
      <input x="480" y="922" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(2) 41-42 is the monitor. Do not use it in" />
      <input x="480" y="938" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="the safety path. Its state is TBC." />
      <input x="480" y="954" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(3) 33-34 is spare. Do not load it." />
      <input x="480" y="970" rotation="0" font="Liberation Sans,10,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" text="(4) Each STO wire goes to the S200 and to" />
